1
00:00:02,469 --> 00:00:05,369
We were worried
about you.

2
00:00:05,372 --> 00:00:07,372
Don't be melodramatic.

3
00:00:07,374 --> 00:00:08,974
I'm just getting on a train

4
00:00:08,976 --> 00:00:11,206
and leaving forever.

5
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:14,451
So a few things
don't go your way

6
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:15,818
and your best
decision

7
00:00:15,816 --> 00:00:18,386
is to ride the
rails like a hobo?

8
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:20,655
Leonard, I am overwhelmed.

9
00:00:20,654 --> 00:00:21,754
(Sheldon:)Everything
is changing,

10
00:00:21,755 --> 00:00:24,155
and it's simply too much.

11
00:00:24,157 --> 00:00:25,827
I need to get away and think.

12
00:00:25,826 --> 00:00:27,326
(Scene:)Sheldon...

13
00:00:27,327 --> 00:00:29,127
Yes?

14
00:00:29,129 --> 00:00:31,059
I'm gonna miss you.

15
00:00:31,064 --> 00:00:33,764
Of course you are.

16
00:00:35,435 --> 00:00:37,865
You just made
that easier.

17
00:00:41,942 --> 00:00:44,012
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

18
00:00:46,947 --> 00:00:48,947
(Sheldon:)Is it at all possible

19
00:00:48,949 --> 00:00:51,049
(Sheldon:)that you're knitting
a pair of pants?

20
00:00:52,819 --> 00:00:55,119
(Sheldon:)Oh, well, no, you're
understandably terrified.

21
00:00:55,122 --> 00:00:57,792
(Sheldon:)But, you know,
allow me to explain.

22
00:00:57,791 --> 00:01:00,931
(Sheldon:)45 days ago, um,
I embarked on

23
00:01:00,928 --> 00:01:02,458
(Sheldon:)a railroad journey
of healing

